window.products.push({"id":570322,"name":"2 Ply Printed Flannel 8x8 Inches Set of 5 Little Wipes Touring Wonders","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519U3fyALvL.jpg","description":"Stack of 5 washable eco-friendly alternative to paper towels, napkins, and throw away baby wipes. **This wondrous set takes you across the globe to some of the most popular touring destinations.** Extra thick** to help with those big messes. This is a great way to help eliminate trash, and an easy way to help the environment. The Little Wipes are perfect for little hands, but are thirsty enough to dry big hands, too. Great for casual, every day napkins (and they won't fall apart like paper napkins do). Nice and gentle enough for little ones face or behind; and, a great thing to keep in your purse for messy emergencies when you are on the road. The Little Wipes are serged around the edges with long lasting, but very soft polyester thread for a clean finish. You can expect these work-horses to last for a very long time. Use them to mop up any spill, dry your hands, or for any typical use of paper towels. I throw mine in the washer and dryer with any and all loads of laundry (they take up very little space), because no special care is required. These napkins are perfect for a gift for the girl in your life. Try them and love them, or send them back for a 100% refund. Cut, sewn, and finished here in the USA by Americans. This set is in stock, and ready to go. ***Sets may vary","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519U3fyALvL.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gina's Soft Cloth Shop","source_asin":"B07PKQPNDP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-570322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PKQPNDP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PKQPNDP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":570323,"name":"Bamboo Dinnerware 12 Piece Set - Reusable Tableware, Dinner Plates and Bowls - Indoor/Outdoor Shatterproof Dishes with Stylish Design Perfect for Picn","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FDh9eBWZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ENVIRONMENTALLY CONSCIOUS, STYLISHLY DESIGNED Whether you’re camping in the backyard or traveling to the other side of the country, this durable dinnerware set will provide great use there and back again. Serve your food on unique dishware without the worry of breaking them. Reusable and shatterproof, these bamboo plates and bowls are perfect for outdoor parties, BBQs, picnics, and more. Made from bamboo fiber, the dish set has all of the benefits of plastic with none of the negative environmental impacts. They are also dishwasher safe for easy cleanup. All of the dishes have been custom designed with prints that no one else has. Mix and match your set with our various matte finish colors to make a truly unique dinner display. WHAT’S INCLUDED: 4 x Large plates 4 x Side plates 4 x Bowls 1 x Ply box for storage PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS 10.6 x 10.6 x 6.3 inches Bamboo fiber (an eco-friendly version of melamine) Colors: Cool grey, natural bamboo or ocean teal DURABLE DINNERWARE FOR THE LONG HAUL We road-tested these plates and bowls for three months to ensure that they are unbreakable, no matter the bumps in the road, and should be a staple for anyone who travels. The reusable ply box that’s included with your purchase makes for easy storage and transportation, whether in an RV or mobile home or for taking outdoors to eat with family and friends. Produced from sustainable and fast-growing bamboo, this material is mostly biodegradable and is the perfect alternative to melamine. When you’re having fun exploring the world, you shouldn’t have to worry about the inconvenience of your dishes breaking. And you won’t have to with our stylish, eco-friendly bamboo dishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FDh9eBWZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Solomon Says","source_asin":"B07T8Z554F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-570323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07T8Z554F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07T8Z554F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
