window.products.push({"id":570408,"name":"Now Designs Hemstitch Cotton Napkins, Bulk Set of 12, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nzuAlDORL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Cloth napkins are an easy way to change the look of any table setting. Casual or formal, a high-quality cloth napkin is sure to compliment any dining event. For daily dining to Holiday Dinners, you can't beat the simple elegance and timeless look of Hemstitch Napkins. Hemstitch napkins are unique because of their beautifully finished hems which feature a very small row of perfectly aligned openings. The resulting look is a understated, small patterned border around the entire napkin, giving it its timeless charm. Each Hemstitch napkin is square shaped, measuring 20 inches long by 20 inches wide. The hems and corners of each napkin are carefully constructed, so you don't have to worry about fraying, uneven or loose hems. These napkins were designed to be durable, functional and versatile. Each napkin in the Hemstitch Napkin Collection is made from 100% cotton and is machine washable. Because these cotton napkins are washable and reusable, they are an earth and budget friendly alternative to disposable napkins. Hemstitch napkins are designed to coordinate with Now Designs' Spectrum Basic Cotton placemats and Spectrum Chair Pads (both placemats and chair pads are sold separately on Amazon). Mix and match Napkins and Placemats for a bright, eclectic look or stay with one color hue for a subtle, cohesive statement. The Hemstitch Napkin collection is designed and made by Now Designs: creators of exclusive home and kitchen products with style and the finest quality in mind for 50 years.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nzuAlDORL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Now Designs","source_asin":"B00S9LBAUQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-570408","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S9LBAUQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S9LBAUQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
