window.products.push({"id":570766,"name":"Cordless Blackout Bamboo Roman Shades, Custom Woven Wood Window Shades, Light Filtering Bamboo Roman Blinds With 6 Inches Valance, Bamboo Linen Sun Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812NhGHBf2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DESCRIPTION: The woven roman shades are made of bamboo and linen, highlight the beauty of natural materials and make you feel like in nature. All Shades come with 6\"H matching valance. Bamboo shades without liner gently filter light and view through but still protect privacy. Bamboo shades with liner block about 90% light and unwanted views from outside. Cordless design is safe for children and pets, just gently push weighted bottom bar to control shade. All mounting hardware is included. ORDER CONFIRMATION: We provide custom service to make sure the blind can fit your window perfectly, we can do size to 1/16\". Select the pattern you like then click the \"Customize Now\" bottom, leave all the information according to the instructions as detailed as possible. We will send email to all customers to double confirm the size in 24 hours, please make sure you will reply email timely. If we don't get your reply in 48 hours, we will make the blinds as your order customizations. INSIDE MOUNT WIDTH: Inside mount require a MIN 2\" window frame depth. You need choose the exact WINDOW inside width and height to place order, then WE WILL MINU 0.4\" (the mounting space) base on your window width to the final shade width, and make the final shade height the same as your window height. For example, if your window inside are 35.75\" wide by 42\" high, select 35\"W and 12/16\" as the order width, select 42\"H as the order height,the roller shade you get will be 35.35\" Wide by 42\" High. OUTSIDE MOUNT WIDTH: The shade width and length should be 3\" to 10\" wider than window for better coverage. You need choose the FINAL SHADE width and height to place order. For example, if your window is 40.75\" wide by 58\" height, the shade should be at least 44\"wide and 63\" high, you need to select 44\" W x 63\" H to place order. We will MAKE NO DEDUCTION, you will get the exact shade size you ordered 44\"W by 63\"H. For outside mount, if there is enough space, the bigger the better. SHIPPING: WE DO NOT DELIVER TO PO BOX and APO ADDRESSES. Courier companies do not deliver to PO boxes and the shades are too long to Post. Please provide your delivery address. Couriers deliver 9am-5pm weekdays and ask to sign Proof of Delivery, so it could be your work address, too. When you shop from us, we will make sure your project to be a success. No matter if you made a mistake or there are other issues, you will be covered. Any question you can contact us with Amazon email.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812NhGHBf2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PASSENGER PIGEON","source_asin":"B0B82KD9NK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-570766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B82KD9NK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B82KD9NK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
