window.products.push({"id":570936,"name":"Supernal Safe Mandoline Slicer For Kitchen,Vegetable Slicer Mandolin (5 Kind Blades),Food Onion Vegetable Chopper,Cheese Slicer,French Fry Cutter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UgVyuLqnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Vegetable Slicer Mandolin: Our slicer mandolin has five different sized chopper blades for slicing, julienne, matchstick (1.5mm slice, 2.5mm slice, 3.9mm slice,3x3mm thick julienne,3x6mm thin julienne). You can also use it to slice meat (NOTE: The meat must be frozon before slicing, and needed to be without bones.Or the blades will be damaged.) Safe Mandoline Slicer：The mandoline slicer is completely safe,convenience and versatility. It's a all–in–one safe adjustable mandoline slicer for kitchen.Only by changing the blades type and pressing the handle, you can cut various vegetables, fruits and meat into a unique shape and thickness that best suit your desire, such as slices, strips, julienne, and dices. No tedious cleaning work, you can rinse it by water. NEW DESIGN: The new hand-grip and push-type design is more labor-saving, more ergonomic, lever principle, long-term use, hands will not be sore, hands away from the blade, press it down to slice or shred. The silicone non-slip base design makes the operation more smooth and stable. EASY TO CLEAN：Do not directly touch the sharp blade with your hands to prevent injury. Please use the cleaning brush to scrape and sweep off residue on the press plate and the blades. Rinse, dry, and set aside.Please don't put the food chopper in the dishwasher! PERFECT GIFTS AND ESSENTIALS FOR MODERN KITCHENS：Supernal Vegetables Chopper Slicer has a simple and atmospheric packaging box which is perfect for wedding gifts,holiday gifts or new home gifts,special occasion gifts for dear friends and family surprises.If you have any quesitons regarding the veggie slicer,please feel free to send the seller a message through Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UgVyuLqnL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"supernal","source_asin":"B0BXCW7SJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-570936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXCW7SJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXCW7SJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
