window.products.push({"id":570938,"name":"MJL Furniture Designs The Sole Secret Shoe Storage Bench Retro Series with Upholstered Vinyl, 53\" x 20\" x 20.5\", Black/Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":177.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JAzuQlrUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Sole Secret Retro Series by MJL Furniture Designs is a throwback to the good old days where vinyl was king. The Shoe Bench combines the functionality and organizational aspects of the Sole Secret and upholsters it with a premium vinyl fabric to give it the comfortable retro flare. Vinyl in itself provides resistance to moisture and humidity and is extremely easy to clean. Additionally the versatility of the fabric gives it a longer lifespan making it a good choice for constantly used pieces of furniture. Built with a hardwood frame with square legs and upholstered with a premium blend of vinyl in an assortment of colors, the shoe ottoman is a useful addition to the entryway, bedroom, living room or play room. The lift top can be easily opened and closed with the easy access hydraulics and reveals 18 individual shoe slots. The shoe slot can accommodate up to Men's size 12 and Women's Size 14 shoes. The shoe slots are made of quality durable wood and more importantly are completely removable. Store your shoes, blankets, linens, handbags and even toys. The shoe bench also provides a comfortable seating space when closed. Each bench is upholstered by hand right here in the USA and made specifically for you. The bench arrives with only leg assembly required and can be put to use the moment you take it out the box. If your shoes could fit in a bench, make it a nice bench, make it a Sole Secret. About MJL Furniture Designs. MJL Furniture is a USA based furniture manufacturer with a combined 45 years of experience in the upholstery industry. MJL Furniture manufactures stylish, affordable, quality furniture for the home and office. All products are made to order from our facility in Arcadia, California. MJL Furniture strives to produce new and innovative products that meet the ever changing demands of the home furnishings industry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JAzuQlrUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MJL Furniture Designs","source_asin":"B01EY4I9ZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-570938","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01EY4I9ZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01EY4I9ZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":570939,"name":"Hanging wine bottle and glass rack made from oak wine barrel staves","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zLWIpPn4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Hanging Wine Barrel Stave Wine Glass Rack This is a wine glass rack that is completely made from recycled wine barrel staves. The wine glass rack will hold up to 24 glasses on the pre-notched glass holders built into the wine rack. The bottle rack is mounted on top and will hole 7 bottles The wine glass rack has been sanded and sealed but we make sure not to remove the uniqueness and caricature that the used wine barrel staves have to offer from years of use in a Napa Valley's winery. You can still make out where the barrel bands have rested on the staves when it was a full wine barrel and on the top you can still find the red wine stain from soaking up some of Napa's finest red wine Hanging hardware is installed on the rack, chain and ceiling hooks are not included. The wine glass rack measures approx. 37\" wide x 16\" deep Sorry we do not ship to AK or HI Made by Wine Barrel Creations","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91zLWIpPn4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wine Barrel Creations","source_asin":"B004SCL4O2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-570939","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004SCL4O2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004SCL4O2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
